### Market Gateway health
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/health

### Market Gateway providers
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/providers

### OKX latest quote through Market Gateway
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/quotes/latest?provider=okx&instType=SPOT&symbol=BTC&quoteSymbol=USDT
X-Request-Id: gateway-demo-quote

### OKX order book through Market Gateway
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/order-book?provider=okx&instId=BTC-USDT&depth=20
X-Request-Id: gateway-demo-depth

### OKX recent public trades through Market Gateway
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/trades/recent?provider=okx&instId=BTC-USDT&limit=20
X-Request-Id: gateway-demo-trades

### OKX klines through Market Gateway
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/klines?provider=okx&instId=BTC-USDT&bar=1m&limit=100
X-Request-Id: gateway-demo-klines

### Same quote when internal token is enabled on gateway
GET http://localhost:18080/api/v1/market/quotes/latest?provider=okx&instType=SPOT&symbol=BTC&quoteSymbol=USDT
X-Request-Id: gateway-demo-auth
X-Internal-Token: change-me
